From 5be47214b133f96a0e200b6d0f72ae8b5db07ec3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Deniz Kokden <koekdendeniz@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 15:28:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 005/110] ARM: sprd: shared ADI helpers, restart via SC2723
 PMIC watchdog

Move the ADI bus access out of the USB bring-up into adi.c so it can be
shared, and add a restart handler that does what the Samsung vendor kernel
does: clear the upload magic, leave INFORM2/3 and the PMIC boot mode for
sboot ("recovery" boots the recovery partition), then let the PMIC
watchdog fire after 50 ms.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Deniz Kokden <koekdendeniz@gmail.com>
---
